00:01:12,599 --> 00:01:14,700
Colitas flower

21
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:20,700
Oh, who's that pretty lady next to him?

22
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:21,700
Her name is Su Wu

23
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:28,080
Back then, she almost became your aunt

24
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,800
Oh?! Old Nine actually had a girlfriend

25
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:32,440
Why have I never seen her before

26
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:33,560
Because

27
00:01:34,880 --> 00:01:37,000
In the end, he still chose Yunfeng

28
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:39,840
Yunfeng, that bastard

29
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:42,719
He promised me he'd take good care of Su Wu for life

30
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:45,400
But who knew

31
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:47,760
He actually got involved in making banned drugs

32
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:48,840
Harmed countless people

33
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:52,240
Even Su Wu fell victim to drug trials

34
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:55,000
After he killed Su Wu

35
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,760
He disappeared without a trace

36
00:01:56,760 --> 00:02:00,319
I once swore to heaven

37
00:02:00,319 --> 00:02:02,519
I must find him!!

38
00:02:02,519 --> 00:02:04,840
Oh, Uncle's crying

39
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,239
Uncle

40
00:02:06,239 --> 00:02:07,939
Forget about the past

41
00:02:07,939 --> 00:02:09,900
Detective Chen

42
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:11,680
According to my investigation

43
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:13,319
Yunfeng's disappearance

44
00:02:13,319 --> 00:02:14,680
doesn't seem so simple

45
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:16,680
Uncle

46
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:18,979
The tree in the photo is so majestic

47
00:02:18,979 --> 00:02:22,840
Looks like it's been growing for hundreds of years

48
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:25,120
That place is called Su Wu Ridge

49
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:26,979
There are many ancient trees

50
00:02:26,979 --> 00:02:29,240
Because it shares the same name as Su Wu

51
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:31,860
So we'd go there to play all the time

52
00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:34,159
Back then, the three of us made a pact

53
00:02:34,159 --> 00:02:35,900
That when we were old and gray

54
00:02:35,900 --> 00:02:37,520
We'd come live here in seclusion

55
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:38,920
Far from worldly strife

56
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:41,560
But Su Wu will never return to Su Wu Ridge

57
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:47,560
Aunt Su Wu is gone

58
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:49,780
The doctor went to Su Wu Ridge to find her

59
00:02:49,780 --> 00:02:53,360
Someone's listening!

60
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,819
It's Goldsworth's men

61
00:02:54,819 --> 00:02:55,939
Move it!

62
00:02:55,939 --> 00:02:58,360
We have to find Yunfeng before they do

63
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:58,960
Where do we even look?

64
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,780
Rather than wait for the poison to hit you

65
00:03:00,780 --> 00:03:02,800
We might as well try Su Wu Ridge

66
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:06,020
Like you've never been poisoned yourself

67
00:03:15,020 --> 00:03:16,699
Is Yunfeng really here?

68
00:03:35,699 --> 00:03:36,020
Such weird flowers

69
00:04:00,699 --> 00:04:00,960
Aunt Su Wu

70
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,460
Kid, do you know her?

71
00:04:05,460 --> 00:04:09,500
Yunfeng!

72
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:13,180
Uncle, help!

73
00:04:13,180 --> 00:04:14,699
The killer doctor showed up!

74
00:04:14,699 --> 00:04:15,699
Yunfeng

75
00:04:24,699 --> 00:04:25,639
Why did you kill Su Wu?

76
00:04:25,639 --> 00:04:27,040
Why?

77
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:29,620
Jimmy!

78
00:04:29,620 --> 00:04:30,379
I...

79
00:04:30,379 --> 00:04:34,420
You're a beast in human form!

80
00:04:42,279 --> 00:04:43,139
Detective Chen!

81
00:04:43,139 --> 00:04:44,560
Calm down!

82
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:52,860
Thank you all so much for helping me find Miracle Doctor Yunfeng.

83
00:04:52,860 --> 00:04:54,000
Goldsworth!

84
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:58,240
Yunfeng, didn't expect this, did you?

85
00:04:58,240 --> 00:05:00,600
You've been hiding from me for so long,

86
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:04,620
But in the end, your own best friend found you.

87
00:05:04,620 --> 00:05:06,920
Hurry up and give me the Colitas flower seeds!

88
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,699
Hmph! Goldsworth.

89
00:05:08,699 --> 00:05:12,379
Back then, you claimed you were making a cancer-curing drug,

90
00:05:12,379 --> 00:05:13,519
To bring hope to the world.

91
00:05:13,519 --> 00:05:15,439
I believed you.

92
00:05:15,439 --> 00:05:17,079
So I joined you in cultivating

93
00:05:17,079 --> 00:05:18,060
The Colitas flowers.

94
00:05:18,060 --> 00:05:19,959
Who knew you'd secretly change the formula,

95
00:05:19,959 --> 00:05:21,839
And extract an addictive drug.

96
00:05:21,839 --> 00:05:22,979
In the end, it ruined countless lives.

97
00:05:22,979 --> 00:05:24,939
Now, these poisonous flowers

98
00:05:24,939 --> 00:05:26,759
Have all been destroyed by me!

99
00:05:26,759 --> 00:05:27,659
What?!

100
00:05:27,659 --> 00:05:34,659
You can't even lie convincingly!

101
00:05:34,659 --> 00:05:37,199
The Colitas flowers are clearly right here!

102
00:05:37,199 --> 00:05:40,819
And you've dealt with poisonous flowers before.

103
00:05:40,819 --> 00:05:42,680
The male ones make the forbidden drug.

104
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:45,160
But these I've carefully cultivated—

105
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,840
female flowers for the antidote.

106
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:48,680
Male or female, I don't care!

107
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:50,120
Take them all away!

108
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,959
Stop!

109
00:05:51,959 --> 00:05:54,920
Locky!

110
00:05:54,920 --> 00:06:07,420
Yunfeng! You quack! Want to die?!

111
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:16,360
Put me down right now!

112
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:20,000
You scoundrel! You finally got yours!

113
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:26,860
Uncle, you can control the trees?

114
00:06:26,860 --> 00:06:31,379
These century-old trees are very spiritual.

115
00:06:31,379 --> 00:06:33,500
With my careful watering,

116
00:06:33,500 --> 00:06:35,300
they naturally follow my command.

117
00:06:35,300 --> 00:06:38,040
Cut the act, kid!

118
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:42,800
I've always seen healing the sick

119
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:44,620
as my lifelong duty.

120
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:46,140
But Goldsworth used me.

121
00:06:46,140 --> 00:06:48,600
When I learned the truth,

122
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,280
I took the seeds

123
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,520
and escaped his clutches.

124
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:53,439
I began developing an antidote.

125
00:06:53,439 --> 00:06:56,160
Colitas is a bloodthirsty flower.

126
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:58,280
To grow, it must feed on the blood of

127
00:06:58,280 --> 00:06:59,660
a human of the same sex.

128
00:06:59,660 --> 00:07:01,620
When I cultivated the male flower,

129
00:07:01,620 --> 00:07:02,980
I used my own blood.

130
00:07:02,980 --> 00:07:05,180
But for the antidote female flower,

131
00:07:05,180 --> 00:07:07,480
no suitable female blood could be found.

132
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:10,840
That was when Su Wu appeared before me.

133
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:12,840
After learning of my plan,

134
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:15,319
she refused to be dissuaded

135
00:07:15,319 --> 00:07:18,120
and resolutely insisted on helping me cultivate the female flower.

136
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:21,200
Jimmy,

137
00:07:21,200 --> 00:07:24,319
back then, Su Wu didn't truly leave you.

138
00:07:24,319 --> 00:07:26,040
She just didn't want you to see

139
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:27,980
how haggard she had become

140
00:07:27,980 --> 00:07:29,759
from cultivating the Colitas flower.

141
00:07:29,759 --> 00:07:32,379
But in the end, I was too eager for quick results.

142
00:07:32,379 --> 00:07:34,580
And that's when tragedy struck.

143
00:07:34,580 --> 00:07:37,319
Su Wu!

144
00:07:37,319 --> 00:07:38,319
No!!

145
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:41,319
Yunfeng...

146
00:07:41,319 --> 00:07:42,319
You...

147
00:07:42,319 --> 00:07:45,319
No...

148
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:49,319
Ah... so that's how it was.

149
00:07:51,319 --> 00:07:55,319
Our recklessness was like that male flower, poisoning all living things—

150
00:07:55,319 --> 00:07:56,319
greedy and selfish.

151
00:07:56,319 --> 00:07:58,319
Not knowing how to think for others

152
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:01,319
And this gentle, selfless female flower

153
00:08:01,319 --> 00:08:03,319
is the very embodiment of Su Wu

154
00:08:07,319 --> 00:08:08,819
She was the one I called here

155
00:08:08,819 --> 00:08:10,079
I am a sinner too

156
00:08:10,079 --> 00:08:12,819
Once I cure everyone poisoned by the male flowers

157
00:08:12,819 --> 00:08:14,319
I'll go back and turn myself in

158
00:08:15,319 --> 00:08:16,319
Jimmy

159
00:08:16,319 --> 00:08:17,319
We'll meet again

160
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:32,319
So this is human love?

161
00:08:33,319 --> 00:08:35,319
Where on earth is Goldsworth?

162
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:37,320
What's he doing in a tree?

163
00:09:24,299 --> 00:09:25,920
My beloved Lord Eye

164
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:29,960
Mr.K presents you with a Colitas flower

165
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:37,220
Idiot!

166
00:09:37,220 --> 00:09:39,340
What you brought is the female Colitas flower

167
00:09:39,340 --> 00:09:41,340
Not the male flower I wanted at all!

168
00:09:41,340 --> 00:09:43,520
You're fired!

169
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:44,520
【Ending Theme】

170
00:09:49,500 --> 00:09:50,000
So unlike

171
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:54,220
being alone and lonely

172
00:09:54,220 --> 00:09:57,640
That's life

173
00:09:57,640 --> 00:10:02,100
some unhappiness is inevitable

174
00:10:02,100 --> 00:10:05,279
The farewell rite

175
00:10:05,279 --> 00:10:09,639
always leaves one feeling lost

176
00:10:09,639 --> 00:10:13,060
Look at tomorrow

177
00:10:13,060 --> 00:10:17,460
Waving to me from the horizon

178
00:10:17,460 --> 00:10:21,120
Every day, sunrise to sunset

179
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:25,100
Drifting through time, dreaming more

180
00:10:25,100 --> 00:10:27,600
Waiting for life's

181
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:30,139
Every second, every moment

182
00:10:30,139 --> 00:10:36,860
My bright eyes are shining

183
00:10:36,860 --> 00:10:40,240
Gazing at the sunlit smile

184
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:45,460
Treading softly at this silent crossing

185
00:10:54,220 --> 00:10:56,399
Mr. Dream, you're back!

186
00:10:56,399 --> 00:10:59,379
You got kidnapped right on Fengxue Road?!

187
00:10:59,379 --> 00:11:29,360
by bwd6